// Optional: custom path to the uvx binary. Defaults to "uvx", but Zed
// spawns context servers with a GUI-minimal PATH (zed-industries/zed
// #60800), so a bare name fails if uvx lives outside /usr/bin:/bin.
// Prefer an absolute path, e.g. "/opt/homebrew/bin/uvx". UV_NO_PROGRESS=1
// is set automatically by the extension.
{
  "uvx_path": "uvx"
}
